# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #fields, #method-parts, #dynamic: a free name is a runtime input, never a data field by a
# coincidence of names): k in S is the root k, 5, not the k of D, 77, and k: k + 1 changes only the value of this
# activation, neither D\k nor the root k. got is declared by S, so it is the got of D and hides the root got, which
# keeps 1. Entry 7.
int: k 5
int: got 1
S:
    int: got
    k: k + 1
    got: k
end: S
D:
    int: k 77
    int: got 0
end: D
fn: unit_k () int
    return: node\k
end: unit_k
fn: unit_got () int
    return: node\got
end: unit_got
call: S D
int: r 81
if: D\got = 6 && D\k = 77 && unit_k() = 5 && unit_got() = 1
    r: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
